        dct:description "shared color scale; subobscura flat; takahashii longer waves — docs/media/drosophila_suzukii_turing_wavelength_s0_comparison.png: rendered output of models/2026-delphi10000-drosophila-suzukii-turing-wavelength-s0.py at 0c76d15d, image/png, 562769 B, 1584×984 px, artifact_sha256 e240d3ff629f62b8628ad36760770d1c8f961a5e7ca4c4daa4fa8196d85b386a (sha256 e240d3ff629f62b8628ad36760770d1c8f961a5e7ca4c4daa4fa8196d85b386a), spec_fingerprint 8f4a40558dfdd1a363ec347c2232dbab086e21c6d2b0baf5b5a36feb603bb029" .
